# s5_trace_nograd: trace under no_grad (no retained float32 forward pass). On s1-s4. At s4's peak the
# largest recorder entry is heap:libc10.so+0x4a675, 1201475584 B, containing this object.
SHAFT_LEVERS=plaintext_free_cpu,encrypt_spill_cpu,triple_share_free_cpu,onnx_single_file_export_cpu,trace_nograd_cpu
